From 1ae940c7ff1ba98762704c7acb8b02845ecf7abf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craig Shaw <craig@craigshaw.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 19:59:57 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Time AOT port polls with bounded status epilogues

Flush pending APU time before instruction-timed port access and preserve the pacing scope. Allow validated polls and the required status, word-indirect and accumulator forms while keeping terminal status-restore blocks in the scheduler interpreter.

Co-authored-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>
